From 978b0441f83625f23ba341f2a35bb1c6ab96eeec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lauri Ojansivu <x@xet7.org>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:57:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [TRANSLATION] Translate the user interface into Finnish
 (fi-FI)

Problem: Much of LiberNT's user interface had no Finnish resources, or
Finnish resources with English left in them, and the newest LiberNT
Setup pages were in English only.

Why: A LiberNT set to Finnish shows its whole user interface in Finnish.

How: Add or complete the fi-FI resources of every module that includes
its language files, with the same controls, ids and format specifiers
as en-US, and include them; name the shell folders as the Finnish
userenv, mmsys and syssetup create them, so interop:LocaleTests finds
them alike.
